    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The nightmare business trip is back with a vengeance!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will be spending a horror filled 3 nights at the hotel. Your room this time around, is a rather large one complete with a bed and bath.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>If you find anomalies, call the reception to have them change rooms. If everything looks fine, go to bed and have a good night.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Next Business Trip&quot; is a short game in first-person perspective.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It takes about 30 to 60 minutes to play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The controls are very simple.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mouse and WASD keys for walking. Left click to select and right click to zoom only.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you are prone to motion sickness, please lower the sensitivity of the mouse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a horror game where players must spot anomalies in a closed room to escape. Inspired by The Exit 8.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are free to make your own video streaming.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, you are responsible for any damage caused by posting and distributing videos.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The nightmare business trip is back with a vengeance!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will be spending a horror filled 3 nights at the hotel. Your room this time around, is a rather large one complete with a bed and bath.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>If you find anomalies, call the reception to have them change rooms. If everything looks fine, go to bed and have a good night.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Next Business Trip&quot; is a short game in first-person perspective.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It takes about 30 to 60 minutes to play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The controls are very simple.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mouse and WASD keys for walking. Left click to select and right click to zoom only.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you are prone to motion sickness, please lower the sensitivity of the mouse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a horror game where players must spot anomalies in a closed room to escape. Inspired by The Exit 8.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are free to make your own video streaming.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, you are responsible for any damage caused by posting and distributing videos.</p>",
